l,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main one-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Another great explainer video!</h2>\r\n<p>If you spend a little time looking through my blog, you'll find a huge range of different voiceover jobs. However, you may notice that perhaps my most common voiceover job is for <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a>. This kind of video is perfect for getting across complex processes, often for companies with intricate products or services that really need to spend a little while explaining their products for customers to understand why they're so good. If you'd like to hear a few more of my explainer videos, check out my <a href=\"/my-dpd-explainer-voice-over\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"DPD Brexit\">DPD Brexit</a>, <a href=\"/michelin-cross-climate-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Michelin Cross Climate\">Michelin Cross Climate</a>, or <a href=\"/wirecard-male-voice-over\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Wirecard\">Wirecard</a> videos.</p>"}}],false,false]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/urbaser-recycling-explainer-video.jpg","alt":"urbaser-recycling-explainer-video","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A little more about Urbaser</h2>\r\n<p>I provided voiceover for this excellent explainer video through <a href=\"https://bexmedia.net\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"BexMedia\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BexMedia</a>, who do some amazing animation and motion graphics. Urbaser is a leading provider of recycling and eeaste disposal services in the UK, but they also operate in Madrid, Paris, Porto, and parts of South America. Urbaser is a huge company and it seems to have a fantastic reputation. In this explainer video, they demonstrate enthusiasm for waste management and a clear respect for the environment. I'd be very happy to work with them on future explainer videos. "}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you've read right to the end of this blog, then I think there might be a good chance you're interested in my voiceover talents. If you'd like me to provide voiceover for your next explainer video,  <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>,  <a href=\"/movie-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Movie Trailer Voiceover\">movie trailer</a>, or something else altogether, then I'm more than happy to hear from you. If looking through various links on this blog doesn't give you a strong enough idea of what I'm capable of, I'd be more than happy to send you a free voiceover sample from your script. That way you can hear whether I'm right for your brand or project. So, what are you waiting for? Get in touch</a>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Urbaser Recycling Explaier Video","pageUrl":"urbaser-recycling-explainer-video"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","972",{"href":"/ai-guy-human-vs-ai-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/guy-ai-voiceoverguy.jpg","alt":"Guy Harris real vs AI voiceover comparison","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Human First! GuyAi vs Human Voice!"}]]}],["$","$L3","661",{"href":"/super-hero-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/super-hero-voice.jpg","alt":"Super Hero Voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Super Hero Voice"}]]}],["$","$L3","879",{"href":"/ariel-pods-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/ariel-pods-voiceover.jpg","alt":"ariel-pods-voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Short How-to Video for Ariel Pods"}]]}]]}]}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/0c73a81f765af814.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en-GB","children":[["$","head",null,{"children":[["$","link",null,{"rel":"icon","href":"/favicon.ico","sizes":"any"}],["$","link",null,{"rel":"icon","href":"/assets/images/voiceover-guy-icon.png","type":"image/png"}],["$","link",null,{"rel":"apple-touch-icon","href":"/assets/images/voiceover-guy-icon.png"}]]}],["$","body",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"top-bar"}],["$","$L8",null,{}],["$","main",null,{"children":["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts"